sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant M as MealPlanning
  participant Q as RabbitMQ
  participant N as NotificationWorker
  participant B as Brevo
  U->>M: Add meal item (date, slot)
  M->>M: Validate rules, save item + Outbox reminder
  M-)Q: reminder.requests
  Q-)N: Consume
  N->>B: Confirmation email at once
  N->>N: Hold in TTL delay queue until ReminderAtUtc
  N->>M: GET /internal/reminders/{id} (X-Internal-Key)
  alt item still exists with same time
    N->>B: Send reminder email
  else deleted or rescheduled
    N->>N: Drop stale reminder
  end
